---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Pricing from '../components/Pricing.astro';
import { aiReadinessHonestyLine } from '../data/visibilityReport';
---

<Layout>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative pt-28 sm:pt-32 pb-14 sm:pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_50%_15%,rgba(99,102,241,0.14),transparent_65%)]"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
    <!-- Open typography gives the message room to wrap without a badge enclosure. -->
    <p class="mb-7 sm:mb-8 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-8 h-px bg-purple-500 mx-auto mb-4"></span>
      <span class="block sm:inline font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#22D3EE]">SEO, Maps, and AI Optimization</span>
      <span class="hidden sm:inline text-muted"> — </span>
      <span class="block sm:inline mt-1 sm:mt-0 text-muted">for local service businesses</span>
    </p>

    <h1 id="hero-title" class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.02] mb-7 sm:mb-8">
      <span class="block text-white">Get Found.</span>
      <span class="block text-[#A855F7]">Get Chosen.</span>
      <span class="block text-[#3B82F6]">Get Customers.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      More calls, bookings and leads from people already looking for what you sell.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto mt-4 mb-8">
      Rank Labs is an SEO and AI Optimization team in Orlando, Florida. We work on the signals Google, Maps
      and AI assistants weigh when they decide which local business to show — and we report the leads we can track.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center items-stretch sm:items-center">
      <a href="/contact?intent=free-audit" class="btn-primary hero-primary text-base">See If You’re Getting Found on AI <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/#how-it-works" class="btn-secondary text-base">See How It Works</a>
      <a href="tel:+14077438964" data-call-location="hero" class="btn-ghost-call text-sm self-center"><svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="shrink-0"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.36 1.9.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.34 1.85.57 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg><span>Call (407) 743-8964</span></a>
    </div>

    <!-- Service scope and published pricing, not customer results. -->
    <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-lg mx-auto mt-9 sm:mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted">Site checks every week</dt>
        <dd class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-1">100+</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted">Per Month</dt>
        <dd class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-1">From $399</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Second fold — Palloma v2: two illustrated sections -->
<section id="why-found" class="py-20 sm:py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden border-y border-white/10 bg-surface/30" aria-labelledby="why-found-title">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_0%_0%,rgba(59,130,246,0.12),transparent_60%)]"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative min-w-0">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-7 lg:gap-16 pb-12 sm:pb-16">
      <div>
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="w-12 h-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-cyan-400 mb-6"></div>
<h2 id="why-found-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.12] max-w-lg text-balance">
          Your Website Exists. But Can Anyone Find It?
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 lg:pt-7">
<p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Having a website doesn't mean your customers can find you.
        </p>
<p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Getting your business to show up on Google's first page, in AI-generated answers, and across other search engines takes more than just a great-looking website. It requires a comprehensive, ongoing strategy — one that has traditionally come with a big-company price tag.
        </p>
<p class="text-white text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-purple-400 pl-5">
          Rank Labs is changing that. We're making advanced SEO and AI search optimization affordable for local businesses.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-7">
          A Website Alone Isn't Enough. Here's Why.
        </h3>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyan-400/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-500/10 to-surface/50 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg><p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-loose mt-5">
          Google dominates online search. Approximately
          <span class="inline-block text-white font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight align-baseline">91%<a href="#why-found-sources" id="ref-stat-1" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline align-super text-[0.65em] font-semibold ml-0.5 hover:text-cyan-200" aria-describedby="source-1">[1]</a></span>
          of searches happen on Google, and only
          <span class="inline-block text-white font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight align-baseline">0.63%<a href="#why-found-sources" id="ref-stat-2" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline align-super text-[0.65em] font-semibold ml-0.5 hover:text-cyan-200" aria-describedby="source-2">[2]</a></span>
          of users click a result on the second page.
        </p></div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-purple-400/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/10 to-surface/50 p-6 sm:p-8"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5Z"/></svg><p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg leading-loose mt-5">
          AI is changing how customers find businesses. When Google displays an AI summary, only about
          <span class="inline-block text-white font-bold text-3xl sm:text-4xl tracking-tight align-baseline">8%<a href="#why-found-sources" id="ref-stat-3" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline align-super text-[0.65em] font-semibold ml-0.5 hover:text-cyan-200" aria-describedby="source-3">[3]</a></span>
          of users click a traditional search result.
        </p></div>
<p class="text-white text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mt-8 mb-8">
          The bottom line? If your business isn't visible where customers are searching, you're missing a lot of opportunities and losing market share.
        </p>
<aside id="why-found-sources" class="border-t border-white/10 pt-6" aria-label="Sources">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-cyan-300 mb-3">Sources</h4>
          <ol class="space-y-2 text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed list-none pl-0">
            <li id="source-1">
              <a href="#ref-stat-1" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline font-semibold mr-1">[1]</a>
              <a href="https://gs.statcounter.com/search-engine-market-share" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-muted hover:text-white underline underline-offset-2">Google 91% of searches (91.05% worldwide) – StatCounter, October 2026</a>
            </li>
            <li id="source-2">
              <a href="#ref-stat-2" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline font-semibold mr-1">[2]</a>
              <a href="https://backlinko.com/google-ctr-stats" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-muted hover:text-white underline underline-offset-2">0.63% of searchers click page 2 – Backlinko Google CTR study, 2025</a>
            </li>
            <li id="source-3">
              <a href="#ref-stat-3" class="text-cyan-300 no-underline font-semibold mr-1">[3]</a>
              <a href="https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2025/07/22/google-users-are-less-likely-to-click-on-links-when-an-ai-summary-appears-in-the-results/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-muted hover:text-white underline underline-offset-2">8% click rate when an AI summary appears – Pew Research Center, July 2025</a>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="what-it-takes" class="py-20 sm:py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="what-it-takes-title">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_85%_35%,rgba(168,85,247,0.08),transparent_60%)]"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative min-w-0">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-9 sm:mb-12">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="w-12 h-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-500 to-cyan-400 mb-6"></div>
<h2 id="what-it-takes-title" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.12] text-balance mb-5">
          What Does It Really Take to Get Found Online?
        </h2><p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          A comprehensive SEO + AI Optimization (AIO) strategy that includes:
        </p>
    </div>
    <ul role="list" class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3 list-none p-0 mb-12 sm:mb-16">
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m8 7-5 5 5 5m8-10 5 5-5 5m-3-13-2 16"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Schema markup and structured data</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 17a9 9 0 1 1 16 0M12 13l4-5"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="1"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Site speed, Core Web Vitals, crawlability, indexing and internal linking</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 5 5"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Comprehensive keyword strategy</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Cost-based and buyer-intent keywords</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 3h10l4 4v14H5Zm9 0v5h5M8 12h8m-8 4h5"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Content strategy, blogs and pages that answer customers' questions</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M9 9v11"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Service and location landing pages</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 10c0 5-7 11-7 11S5 15 5 10a7 7 0 0 1 14 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Google Business Profile and consistent listings across directories</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5Z"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Getting found in ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google's AI answers</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4v16h16M8 14l4-4 3 2 5-7m-5 0h5v5"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Lead tracking and calls to action that turn visits into calls and bookings</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 20V10m7 10V4m7 16v-7"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Monthly ranking and traffic reports</span></li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-surface/60 p-5 sm:p-6 min-w-0 sm:col-span-2"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/15 to-blue-500/10"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-cyan-300" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6Z m-4 9 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><span class="text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">Website maintenance, security and backups, and much more</span></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-14 items-center border-t border-white/10 pt-12 sm:pt-16">
      <div>
<h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
          SEO Isn't a One-Time Fix. It's an Ongoing Strategy.
        </h3>
<p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
          Search rankings change. Competitors evolve. AI search keeps advancing.
        </p>
<p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">
          That's why Rank Labs monitors 100+ optimization factors every week, continuously working to improve your website's performance and visibility.
        </p><p class="text-white text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed mt-7">
          Big-company SEO strategies. Local-business-friendly pricing.
        </p>
      </div>
<div class="rounded-2xl border border-purple-400/30 p-6 sm:p-9 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(168,85,247,0.18),transparent_75%)] shadow-xl shadow-black/10">
          <p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            More visibility means more calls, more bookings and more customers.
          </p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 break-words">
            Is Your Website Ready to Be Found?
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Discover how your website performs on Google and AI-powered search platforms and uncover opportunities you could be missing.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?intent=free-audit" class="btn-primary hero-primary text-base">Get Your FREE AI Optimization Audit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What We Do — Found, Chosen, Booked, Measured -->
<section id="services" class="py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="text-sm text-cyan-300 font-mono mb-4">WHAT WE DO</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Found. Chosen. Booked. Measured.</h2>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-xl mx-auto">Rankings are a means, not the goal. Everything we do is aimed at one thing: more customers contacting you.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      {[
        {
          icon: '🔍',
          title: 'Found: show up where buyers already look',
          desc: 'When someone nearby needs what you do, they search Google, check Maps, or ask an AI assistant. We run 100+ checks on your site every week, fix what holds you back (on Full Management), track Google and Maps rankings for 25 keywords, and do the AI Optimization work: schema, direct answers, AI-crawler access, and freshness.',
        },
        {
          icon: '⭐',
          title: 'Chosen: win the comparison',
          desc: 'Buyers — and the assistants answering for them — compare reviews, hours, prices and how easy you are to reach. We check your business details across 10 listing sites, trace where they conflict with your site and Maps, and (on Full Management) resolve them at the source and keep them from drifting. We also optimize your Google Business Profile (Full Management) and track reviews on Google plus one other site.',
        },
        {
          icon: '📅',
          title: 'Booked: make the next step effortless',
          desc: 'A one-tap call, a short form, or a booking link on every key page. Full Management adds service-area landing pages and an agent-ready booking path that an AI assistant can open for its user.',
        },
        {
          icon: '📈',
          title: 'Measured: see the leads we can track, not just rankings',
          desc: 'Your monthly report compares your Google search, Business Profile, traffic, and the leads we can track with last month, using your GA4, Search Console, and Business Profile data when you give us access. We tell you plainly what we can and can\'t measure yet.',
        },
      ].map((service) => (
        <div class="gradient-border rounded-xl p-6 hover:bg-surface-light/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">{service.icon}</div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">{service.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{service.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-sm text-muted">
      Plus weekly SEO audits, keyword tracking, schema markup, backlink monitoring, content, and full site management.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AI Optimization — how AI assistants decide who to name -->
<section id="geo" class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface/30 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/5 via-purple-500/5 to-cyan-500/5"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="text-sm text-cyan-300 font-mono mb-4">AI OPTIMIZATION</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
        How AI assistants decide<br/>
        <span class="gradient-text">who to name.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Perplexity and Google's AI answers assemble a recommendation from many sources at once — your pages, your structured data, map listings, directories and reviews.
        If those don't line up, the assistant has no confident answer to give, and someone else gets named. We score the on-page side every week and work through the rest as ongoing remediation, not a one-time ticket.
        Beyond that, there's one more layer, being agent-ready (ASO): publishing your hours, prices, location, reviews and booking link as data, so an AI assistant can actually choose you.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-16">
      <!-- AI Optimization checklist (engine-neutral) -->
      <div class="gradient-border rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-purple-500/5 to-transparent md:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-1 sm:gap-3 mb-5">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold">✅ AI Optimization — on-page signals</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-purple-400 font-mono">What every AI assistant reads</div>
        </div>
        <ol class="space-y-3 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6">
          {[
